{"4241540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scission", "steam_appid": 4241540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes, there are souls that fall to the bottom of the waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They sink so deep that even the sun can’t reach them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this hostile environment, the souls form a shell to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A whole in two parts that thickens with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the soul, thinking it is still free, tries to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eventually, it lets them win and accepts the salvation of being offered protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The shell is resistant, resilient, but some say that a fracture can happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They whisper these words to each other:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;With a bang, the shell will become two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They will tear at each other for the soul and will seek its control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Opposed to one another, even if deep down, they need her as much as she needs them.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4ddb24351f0d467c2d8f7095a25e58fe.poster.avif?t=1773414467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4ddb24351f0d467c2d8f7095a25e58fe.webm?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4ddb24351f0d467c2d8f7095a25e58fe.mp4?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control two characters at once</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master this unique mechanic to overcome the challenges thrown at you. Move independently with each hand and position in the optimal way to hit your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/f599ff1274c588b17913a37d333262a3.poster.avif?t=1773414467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/f599ff1274c588b17913a37d333262a3.webm?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/f599ff1274c588b17913a37d333262a3.mp4?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Egyde and Kleos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egyde and Kleos are two sides of the same coin. Join them as they embark on a journey to reach &quot;the surface&quot; and find their purpose. Will they return to the status quo or become something new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4292f69cde9d7e6c5252817a46c5787f.poster.avif?t=1773414467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4292f69cde9d7e6c5252817a46c5787f.webm?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4292f69cde9d7e6c5252817a46c5787f.mp4?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes, there are souls that fall to the bottom of the waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They sink so deep that even the sun can’t reach them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this hostile environment, the souls form a shell to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A whole in two parts that thickens with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the soul, thinking it is still free, tries to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eventually, it lets them win and accepts the salvation of being offered protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The shell is resistant, resilient, but some say that a fracture can happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They whisper these words to each other:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;With a bang, the shell will become two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They will tear at each other for the soul and will seek its control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Opposed to one another, even if deep down, they need her as much as she needs them.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4ddb24351f0d467c2d8f7095a25e58fe.poster.avif?t=1773414467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4ddb24351f0d467c2d8f7095a25e58fe.webm?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4ddb24351f0d467c2d8f7095a25e58fe.mp4?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control two characters at once</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master this unique mechanic to overcome the challenges thrown at you. Move independently with each hand and position in the optimal way to hit your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/f599ff1274c588b17913a37d333262a3.poster.avif?t=1773414467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/f599ff1274c588b17913a37d333262a3.webm?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/f599ff1274c588b17913a37d333262a3.mp4?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Egyde and Kleos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egyde and Kleos are two sides of the same coin. Join them as they embark on a journey to reach &quot;the surface&quot; and find their purpose. Will they return to the status quo or become something new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4292f69cde9d7e6c5252817a46c5787f.poster.avif?t=1773414467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4292f69cde9d7e6c5252817a46c5787f.webm?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241540/extras/4292f69cde9d7e6c5252817a46c5787f.mp4?t=1773414467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Scission is a dark and gruesome action game where you control two characters at once. Fight grotesque representations of the subconscious,